    <MESSAGE value="feat: Add interactive CLI workflows and built-in Misc category&#10;&#10;- Refactored the CLI into a reusable library with interactive console, catalog, category, setup, rules, and settings commands.&#10;- Added the protected system Misc category and exposed its ID through the core categories API.&#10;- Expanded test coverage and updated CMake targets for the CLI and new core features.&#10;- Updated dashboard UI and controller files, and added source-file markers across GUI components." />
    <MESSAGE value="feat: Add daily automatic posting and category-free one-off entries&#10;&#10;- Implement a catch-up daily job with a configurable post-after time, rule-linked entries, and a CLI command to run it manually.&#10;- Allow one-off entries without a category and update day views and CLI displays to label them accordingly.&#10;- Add database migration support for nullable one-off categories, rule-post tracking, and job issue records.&#10;- Integrate daily posting at startup, update CLI and CMake configuration, and expand tests for daily jobs, entries, settings, and commands.&#10;- Update IDE workspace metadata." />
    <MESSAGE value="feat: Add pay periods, income tracking, and savings management&#10;&#10;- Add period summaries, payday recording and delays, income entries, savings pots, and a transaction ledger.&#10;- Expose status, paid, delay, income, and savings workflows in the CLI with formatted displays.&#10;- Add database migration support, synchronize savings-covered expenses, and support month-based date arithmetic.&#10;- Expand tests for periods, savings, migrations, dates, settings, and CLI commands; update CMake targets and IDE workspace metadata." />
    <MESSAGE value="feat: Add event logging across money workflows&#10;&#10;- Record entry, savings, payday, and automatic-posting events with transactional log writes; migrate existing issues into the new log.&#10;- Add a filtered, newest-first `log` CLI command and show issue counts in status output.&#10;- Add shared money formatting and log tests; update CLI text handling, CMake targets, and IDE workspace metadata." />
